# Public URL of the R2 bucket that holds the pipeline output (tiles and side files), with a trailing slash. Leave unset to use app/public/data.
# Set it in the Vercel project's environment variables. The bucket needs CORS (GET, HEAD, Range header allowed).
# Live today: the r2.dev public URL, with ALLOW_R2_DEV=1 set in the Vercel project (scripts/check-deploy.mjs refuses r2.dev otherwise).
VITE_DATA_BASE=https://pub-xxxxxxxx.r2.dev/
# Custom domain (to do before public launch): use https://data.<your-domain>/ instead, drop ALLOW_R2_DEV, and
# add the same origin to connect-src in vercel.json: scripts/check-deploy.mjs fails the Vercel build otherwise.
